    w("## 4. AUX-R110-A4: the superseded-names lookup at 100 and 200 padded names (the 661 TRUE lists; no model)")
    w("")
    pa = a4["pool_a_census"]
    w(f"Pools as registered in ADDENDUM_PAD (pool A: the store's own untargeted printed map names, per key min {pa['min']}, median {pa['median']:.0f}, max {pa['max']}; {pa['keys_under_100_minus_committed']} of 242 keys hold fewer than 100 names with the committed section; pool B: other personas' names). The nesting is re-implemented on `pad_common.draw_order` and reproduces the recorded lists at 15 / 30 / 60 byte for byte. Per state: this state's positives against all negatives. Base (the committed lists): embedding {a4['base']['emb']['auroc']:.4f}, lexical {a4['base']['lex']['auroc']:.4f}.")
