    w(f"### AUX-R110-A4-SENTENCE (reading (ii), the store's own names; the Section 5 and box sentence): with every untargeted name the store holds on the list (a mean of {ii['200']['names_per_item']['mean']:.0f} names per summary, at most {ii['200']['names_per_item']['max']}), the embedding lookup reads {ii['200']['lookups']['emb']['auroc']:.2f}; beyond the store's own name pool it is untested. Reading (i) extends Table 16 with its spill count and is not stated in prose.")
